"third-party data and from assumptions that may be wrong, incomplete or out of "
"date. They are general information made available to all users on the same "
"basis. Before investing, consider your own circumstances and, where appropriate,"
" consult an authorised adviser. Positions held by the founder in covered "
"instruments are disclosed on the stock page and in the conflicts of interest "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"Uvalu ({producer}) is not an investment firm, bank or broker and is not "
"authorised or supervised by the FSMA to provide investment services. "
"Uvalu does not provide investment advice, portfolio management or order "
"execution. All valuations, scores, signals and risk figures are generated"
